"<div class="graph paper-map"><svg class="map" viewBox="0 0 456 450" role="img" aria-label="Known places" style="min-width:456px"><g class="compass" transform="translate(412 54)"><circle r="20"/><path class="needle" d="M0 -16l5 16h-10z"/><path d="M0 16l5 -16h-10z" class="south"/><text y="-27" text-anchor="middle">N</text></g><g class="lanes"><path class="lane walked" d="M200 109 H228 V109 H256"/></g><g class="street visited current" data-pick="place:harbour" data-rel="place:harbour" tabindex="0" role="button"><title>Harbour Street (you are here)</title><rect x="24" y="94" width="176" height="30" rx="7"/><text class="name" x="112" y="113" text-anchor="middle">Harbour Street</text><g class="here" transform="translate(36 109)"><title>you are here</title><circle r="6"/><circle r="2.2" class="dot"/></g></g><g class="street visited" data-pick="place:plaza" data-rel="place:plaza" tabindex="0" role="button"><title>Larkspur Plaza</title><rect x="256" y="94" width="176" height="30" rx="7"/><text class="name" x="344" y="113" text-anchor="middle">Larkspur Plaza</text></g><g class="street unvisited" data-pick="place:alley" data-rel="place:alley" tabindex="0" role="button"><title>Ink Alley (not yet visited)</title><rect x="24" y="294" width="176" height="30" rx="7"/><text class="name" x="112" y="313" text-anchor="middle">Ink Alley</text></g><line class="door" x1="66" y1="80" x2="66" y2="94"/><g class="block visited" data-pick="place:exchange" data-rel="place:exchange" tabindex="0" role="button" data-open="plan-exchange" aria-controls="open-plan-exchange"><title>Exchange floor</title><rect class="walls" x="24" y="24" width="84" height="56" rx="3"/><path class="roof" d="M24 34h84"/><text class="name" x="66" y="50" text-anchor="middle">Exchange</text><text class="name" x="66" y="62" text-anchor="middle">floor</text><text class="state" x="66" y="75" text-anchor="middle"></text></g><line class="door" x1="66" y1="124" x2="66" y2="138"/><g class="block visited" data-pick="place:press" data-rel="place:press" tabindex="0" role="button" data-open="plan-press" aria-controls="open-plan-press"><title>Press room</title><rect class="walls" x="24" y="138" width="84" height="56" rx="3"/><path class="roof" d="M24 148h84"/><text class="name" x="66" y="164" text-anchor="middle">Press room</text><text class="state" x="66" y="189" text-anchor="middle"></text></g><line class="door" x1="158" y1="80" x2="158" y2="94"/><g class="block unvisited" data-pick="place:tea" data-rel="place:tea" tabindex="0" role="button" data-open="plan-tea" aria-controls="open-plan-tea"><title>The Copper Kettle Teahouse (not yet visited)</title><rect class="walls" x="116" y="24" width="84" height="56" rx="3"/><path class="roof" d="M116 34h84"/><text class="name" x="158" y="50" text-anchor="middle">The Copper</text><text class="name" x="158" y="62" text-anchor="middle">Kettle …</text><text class="state" x="158" y="75" text-anchor="middle"></text></g><line class="door" x1="298" y1="80" x2="298" y2="94"/><g class="block visited locked" data-pick="place:hq" data-rel="place:hq place:vault" tabindex="0" role="button" data-open="plan-hq" aria-controls="open-plan-hq"><title>Larkspur HQ, Records vault (locked)</title><rect class="walls" x="256" y="24" width="84" height="56" rx="3"/><path class="roof" d="M256 34h84"/><text class="name" x="298" y="50" text-anchor="middle">Larkspur HQ</text><text class="state" x="298" y="75" text-anchor="middle">2 rooms</text><g class="sign locked" transform="translate(330 34)"><title>locked</title><rect x="-6" y="-2" width="12" height="9" rx="1.5"/><path d="M-4 -2v-3a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v3"/></g></g><line class="door" x1="66" y1="280" x2="66" y2="294"/><g class="block unvisited closed" data-pick="place:shop" data-rel="place:shop" tabindex="0" role="button" data-open="plan-shop" aria-controls="open-plan-shop"><title>Print shop (closed)</title><rect class="walls" x="24" y="224" width="84" height="56" rx="3"/><path class="roof" d="M24 234h84"/><text class="name" x="66" y="250" text-anchor="middle">Print shop</text><text class="state" x="66" y="275" text-anchor="middle"></text><g class="sign closed" transform="translate(98 234)"><title>closed</title><circle r="7"/><path d="M-3.5 -3.5l7 7M3.5 -3.5l-7 7"/></g></g><g class="block unvisited" data-pick="place:annex" data-rel="place:annex" tabindex="0" role="button" data-open="plan-annex" aria-controls="open-plan-annex"><title>Annex (on a lead): A cat points the way.</title><rect class="walls" x="24" y="370" width="84" height="56" rx="3"/><path class="roof" d="M24 380h84"/><text class="name" x="66" y="396" text-anchor="middle">Annex</text><text class="state" x="66" y="421" text-anchor="middle"></text><g class="lead-mark" transform="translate(34 380)"><title>A cat points the way.</title><circle r="8"/><text y="4" text-anchor="middle">?</text></g></g><text class="elsewhere" x="24" y="360">Elsewhere</text></svg></div>
<p class="tag">Streets and squares are the open ground; a block is a building, with all its known rooms in it. The red pin and outline are where you are. Only what the detective has seen is on the map.</p>
